},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b9/b96b2c3496960ca439f2db992dc699be2db075629edd39a75fa770481587477a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a2/a2e561d4e1f468386b3ee000d23cb5d770797e3ec5af3f798f1951fc0d99516b.webp","width":182,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c122847","characterName":"クリ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["12995"],"vndbCharacterId":"c122847"},"originalCharacterName":"クリ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kuri, or Kuri-chan as she refers to herself, is a cutesy commentator who hosts the Tournament Digest of the Toushin Toshi Tournament. She usually appears as a co-host, but she rarely says anything insightful."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From AliceSoft Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c122847"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"大会開催期間中は毎晩放送される、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔法ビジョン（テレビのようなもの）の番組「闘神ダイジェスト」の司会の女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いい加減な試合解説と結構わがままなトークで人気。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12995","sourceWorkId":"11230","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0d1860e7fc4fca7eb093a3c26fa7d4e00c85857c61d07666b44f4eaaa973168e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/00/001e041a88dd9863ad43ef355e1000319247e66b90f7a4dfabea48cbba93daf5.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c59981","characterName":"ドギ・マギ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"87892","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"1095"}],"egsCharacterIds":["12985"],"vndbCharacterId":"c59981"},"originalCharacterName":"ドギ・マギ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"183cm"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"92kg"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"闘神大会出場者。故郷の町では暴力集団のリーダーをしていた粗暴な男。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"巨大な斧を振り回す、力任せの戦い方をする戦士。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"マニを気に入っていて手放そうとしない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"12985","sourceWorkId":"11230","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"明明是乡下盗贼团，实力却强得过分"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自称是魔王之子的男人"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"87892"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ce/cedf6c26feeac45e3f82bae17d84b770186d1e40247ff7c14286fd6622d817a6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/cca728d0a3a346b0970af8f4eef3523d17445441c4d852fe09222b050e623719.webp","width":256,"height":202,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c141617","characterName":"クミコ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c141617"},"originalCharacterName":"クミコ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a beautiful young woman with long pink hair and a tragic past. Her father entered the Toushin Tournament and won, but he never returned or even contacted Kumiko or her mother. Her mother became ill, and eventually died. With no family left, Kumiko set out for Toushin City to search for her father who she suspects is in the Toushin Mansion, residence of the tournament champion."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c141617"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/94/94ade7078a92eb3bf956c86a69ac36c20052c24ea026a185289c3e9657f9a6fc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fdab6456ff01337e75a3c35810a3c88988f7a77ba4f1741aeb63a6d9056426f9.webp","width":255,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c170970","characterName":"カスタム","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c170970"},"originalCharacterName":"カスタム","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A strong fighter in his small village, Custom finds himself with the opportunity to compete in the Toushin Tournament when he rescues Kumiko from a group of Hannies. Wanting both the chance for glory and to help Kumiko find her father, Alexander, Custom travels to Toushin City, where he quickly finds himself outmatched by the world-class competitors."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c170970"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/09/097762d3d4154ced9230db8eafd5edc6c8626683d53aefd4a908d6601c111c5f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/ebe529f87a38937c2408922cb70fdfefa8ec200ee149b0c55ac3b5d78973855e.webp","width":166,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c171037","characterName":"ラセリア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c171037"},"originalCharacterName":"ラセリア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is Custom's level goddess. Like certain other level goddesses such as Willis, Laseria is known to strip as Custom gains levels to incentivize his progress. In addition to filling the usual level god duties of levelling up her client, she has occasionally rescued Custom from near-death, teleporting him out of dungeons and to safety at the last minute."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c171037"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b37a4657b57439e0e3e85dd4aadacbf4641dd18a2b99055d17156070fbdac95d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/ba72dd2db1692cae26bd4e5a5fa18d4f1359d5214be50ca5d9c0759d51eaf87b.webp","width":232,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c64065","characterName":"アリスちゃん","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c64065"},"originalCharacterName":"アリスちゃん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The official mascot of Alice Soft. A polite young girl who often communicates with the player as a medium in some Alice Soft games. She sometimes represent marketing upcoming Alice Soft games in trailers and advertisements."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is accompanied by her pet black crow named Yukichi."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c64065"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5b/5bc2e64ab89c25b9c9a296730a25ea8ee9d73afba0f0c36cd9c47f5dffafc4c3.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d7/d7e1f6b2208f4ea2d61edfe75a557509da448e2e11a06f61a4b6c5542224d82c.webp","width":226,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c80101","characterName":"諭吉","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c80101"},"originalCharacterName":"諭吉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/da/da849cfd1811954aca2acc66ad3877c5cd1cd1de37338584ac13fa26ab66d62d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c5f636b15402b6517e3ffa35d527ef2c1a91bd3248bcd476c8c6f5987244f08f.webp","width":211,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c95529","characterName":"使徒 アトランタ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c95529"},"originalCharacterName":"使徒 アトランタ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Atlanta is a mage and is skilled with many curses and spells. Her most iconic curse is the one that traps her opponent in a Mirror and divides it into several fragments. Those trapped in it cannot get out and their only hope is that someone else finds all the mirror pieces. Once they are all gathered and put together, the victim will be released immediately."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Atlanta is an Apostle of Lexington first (chronologically) seen in Rance IV and later seen in every iteration of the Toushin Toshi series up to date. She's travelling all over The Continent carrying the Demonic Blood Soul of her master searching for a way to bring him back, but she's not very competent, since she's spent a few centuries with no success."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From AliceSoft Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","s